You are helping build EduPulse — a B2B EdTech SaaS platform for Indian coaching institutes.

PROJECT STRUCTURE:
- /frontend — React 19 + Tailwind CSS 4 + Vite 8
- /backend — Python FastAPI + Supabase (PostgreSQL)
- /backend/omr/ — OpenCV OMR scanning module (Week 5-6)

TECH STACK:
- Frontend: React, Tailwind, Vite, Recharts
- Backend: FastAPI, Python 3.12, Supabase client, python-dotenv
- Database: PostgreSQL via Supabase
- Auth: Supabase Auth (3 roles: admin, teacher, student)
- Storage: Supabase Storage for OMR scan images

DATABASE TABLES:
institutes, users, subjects, topics, exams, questions, omr_results, topic_scores

CODING RULES:
- Always use async/await in FastAPI routes
- Always use Supabase client — never raw SQL
- Always handle errors with try/except
- React components use functional style with hooks only
- Never hardcode API URLs — use import.meta.env.VITE_API_URL
- Never commit .env files

CURRENT BUILD: Week 1 Day 2 — Tailwind done, creating database tables next
